<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.3 </span>Full Reranking Results from Ablation Studies</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the analysis in Section <a href="#S4.SS5.SSS1" title="4.5.1 Training Strategies ‣ 4.5 Ablation Study ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Multi-view-guided Passage Reranking with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5.1</span></a>, Table <a href="#A4.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ D.2 Effectiveness of View Aggregation ‣ Appendix D Additional Analysis of MVP ‣ Multi-view-guided Passage Reranking with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> reports the full reranking results from the ablation experiments.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
